11	 * A Saturday or Sunday, or a listed public holiday, rolls forward to the next non-holiday business
12	 * day. Shared by {@link BuildOwner} (which stamps the stored date) and {@link CheckOwnerDailyLimit}
13	 * (which counts per business day) so both agree on the adjusted date. It also owns the
14	 * per-business-day owner count, so the daily-limit rule and the bulk-signup warning
15	 * ({@link DeriveOwnerBulkSignupWarning}) provably count the same population.
16	 */
