172	     * {@link #getLastName() lastName}: the title, a single space, then the lastName (e.g.
173	     * {@code DR Who}) when a title is present, otherwise just the lastName. Not persisted as a
174	     * separate value; composed from the stored title and last name.
175	     */
176	    public String getSalutation() {
